# CSS Conventions

All CSS files must follow regional structure, column-aligned properties (at ~column 40), and standardized headers.

## File Header

```css
/* =============================================================================
 * NOBLE ARCHITECTURE - [STYLESHEET NAME]
 * =============================================================================
 */
```

---

## Structure Example

```css
/*  #Region ------------------------------------------------
 * REGION | CSS Variables
 * -------------------------------------------------------- */

    :root {
        --App_PrimaryColor         : #555041;            /* Brand color */
        --App_BackgroundLight      : #f5f5f5;            /* Light bg */
    }

/* endregion ---------------------------------------------- */
```

---

## Column Alignment (CRITICAL)

**Align property colons at ~column 40:**

```css
.example {
    margin                     : 0;                      /* No margin */
    padding                    : 1rem;                   /* Standard padding */
    background-color           : #ffffff;                /* White background */
}
```

---

## CSS Variable Naming

**Pattern:** `--App_CategoryName` or `--App_Category_SubName`

```css
:root {
    --App_PrimaryColor         : #555041;                /* Primary brand */
    --App_BackgroundLight      : #f5f5f5;                /* Light mode bg */
    --App_SpacingMedium        : 1rem;                   /* 16px */
}
```

**Categories:** Colors, Backgrounds, Text, Spacing, Layout

---

## Class Naming (BEM)

```css
.component-name { }                    /* Block */
.component-name__part { }              /* Element */
.component-name--modifier { }          /* Modifier */
```

---

## Font Loading

**Fonts are dynamically loaded by `CommonUtils__AssetLoader__.js` at runtime.**

Do **NOT** use `@font-face` declarations in CSS files. The AssetLoader module automatically injects font CSS with absolute URLs.

```css
/*  #Region ------------------------------------------------
 * REGION | Font Face Declarations
 * -------------------------------------------------------- */

    /* Fonts are dynamically loaded by CommonUtils__AssetLoader__.js */
    /* This ensures absolute URLs work correctly on GitHub Pages */

/* endregion ---------------------------------------------- */
```

**Font families available after AssetLoader initialization:**
- `'Open Sans'` with weights: 300 (Light), 400 (Regular), 500 (Medium), 600 (SemiBold), 700 (Bold)

**Usage in CSS:**
```css
body {
    font-family                : 'Open Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-weight                : 400;
}

.header-title {
    font-family                : 'Open Sans';
    font-weight                : 600;                    /* SemiBold */
}
```

---

## Rules

### ALWAYS
- Include file header with `NOBLE ARCHITECTURE - [NAME]`
- Use regional structure with 60-character opening (matches JavaScript standard)
- Column-align property colons at ~column 40
- Use 4-space indent within regions
- Use CSS variables for colors, spacing, repeated values
- Include inline comments for non-obvious properties
- Use BEM naming for components

### NEVER
- Omit file header
- Skip property alignment
- Hardcode colors/spacing (use CSS variables)
- Use tabs instead of spaces
